{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Between Sky and Earth</strong> is a psychological thriller with elements of interactive detective work, horror, and puzzles, set in early 1930s Germany.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/extras/\u0441\u0446\u0435\u043d\u0430_5__1_.gif?t=1748447660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>a hypnotist</strong> whose name is all over 1930s Germany. You can do anything:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">read minds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">cast characters into a trance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">impersonate others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">know the precise time of death of everyone including yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/extras/mmartinn77.gif?t=1748447660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/extras/leona_1.gif?t=1748447660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds hella nice, doesn\u2019t it? Now imagine - one of your experiments goes awry and you swap fates. Which means:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you\u2019re stuck with some alcoholic\u2019s memories permanently in your mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">nightmares haunt you\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you\u2019re a crime accomplice\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">but most importantly: you only have five hours to live</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/extras/mmomm_1.gif?t=1748447660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you unravel the mysteries of the past without going insane and turn back time?  <br>The countdown\u2019s on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/extras/43545543__1_.png?t=1748447660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo</strong> lets you play through the first full hypnosis session, where you dive into the earliest memory of a young pilot \u2014 but under hypnosis, a long-buried episode from his childhood resurfaces, where an innocent game turns into tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What happened that day? And why does it still haunt him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AVAILABLE IN THE DEMO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a childhood memory as an interactive scene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dialogue choices and memory exploration through details and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First glimpse of the core mechanic: hypnosis and mind-reading as tools of investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric sound design and a distinctive visual style</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709220?t=1748447660","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709220?t=1748447660","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/685e0ad2c1805ee95f74cd48345a5ee7f65362d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748447660","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/685e0ad2c1805ee95f74cd48345a5ee7f65362d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748447660","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Strong Language, Violence, Blood and Gore"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Between Sky and Earth</strong> is a psychological thriller with elements of interactive detective work, horror, and puzzles, set in early 1930s Germany.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/extras/\u0441\u0446\u0435\u043d\u0430_5__1_.gif?t=1748447660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>a hypnotist</strong> whose name is all over 1930s Germany. You can do anything:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">read minds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">cast characters into a trance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">impersonate others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">know the precise time of death of everyone including yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/extras/mmartinn77.gif?t=1748447660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/extras/leona_1.gif?t=1748447660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds hella nice, doesn\u2019t it? Now imagine - one of your experiments goes awry and you swap fates. Which means:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you\u2019re stuck with some alcoholic\u2019s memories permanently in your mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">nightmares haunt you\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you\u2019re a crime accomplice\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">but most importantly: you only have five hours to live</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/extras/mmomm_1.gif?t=1748447660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you unravel the mysteries of the past without going insane and turn back time?  <br>The countdown\u2019s on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/extras/43545543__1_.png?t=1748447660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo</strong> lets you play through the first full hypnosis session, where you dive into the earliest memory of a young pilot \u2014 but under hypnosis, a long-buried episode from his childhood resurfaces, where an innocent game turns into tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What happened that day? And why does it still haunt him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AVAILABLE IN THE DEMO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a childhood memory as an interactive scene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dialogue choices and memory exploration through details and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First glimpse of the core mechanic: hypnosis and mind-reading as tools of investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric sound design and a distinctive visual style</p></li></ul>","developers":["menschen eternity"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3140780","name":"Between sky and earth"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709220/f7d4f541193fdcedc1eb70e56c1fdf231e5e3ccd/header.jpg?t=1748447660","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257142350,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142350/movie480.mp4?t=1748447658","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142350/movie_max.mp4?t=1748447658"},"name":"BHE Demo trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.